WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:07.282
In the earlier acceptance run, the Claude worker wrote its handover in German, even though the task and conversation were in English.

00:00:08.236 --> 00:00:15.585
In a fresh run of the same accented text task, Sonnet asks its question in English. The owner can choose how accented letters should be handled.

00:00:16.538 --> 00:00:24.084
After the answer and the full check, the same worker hands its work over in English. Its question and handover now follow the conversation language.
